          {
            "title": "Question: Position",
            "id": 77845,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>O que há de errado com este código?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"is_weekend = \" /><text value=\"False\" class=\"literal\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"else\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;rise and shine&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" is_weekend:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;stay in bed&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"  File &quot;file.py&quot;, line 3\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    else:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"       ^\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"SyntaxError: invalid syntax\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">A declaração <code>else</code> deve vir após a declaração <code>if</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">A declaração <code>else</code> deve ter uma condição</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Não há nada de errado com o código</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">A declaração <code>else</code> deve vir após a declaração <code>if</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Você quer que <code>rise and shine</code> seja a alternativa quando <code>is_weekend</code> for <code>False</code>. Qual alteração torna o código válido?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"is_weekend = \" /><text value=\"False\" class=\"literal\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"else\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;rise and shine&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" is_weekend:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;stay in bed&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"  File &quot;file.py&quot;, line 3\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    else:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"       ^\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"SyntaxError: invalid syntax\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Mova a ramificação <code>else</code> para depois da ramificação <code>if</code>.</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Adicione uma condição depois de <code>else</code>.</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Indente <code>else</code> dentro do bloco de código <code>if</code>.</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Mova a ramificação <code>else</code> para depois da ramificação <code>if</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: No own condition",
            "id": 77841,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Por que a declaração <code>else</code> não tem sua própria condição?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Porque sua condição é o oposto da condição da declaração <code>if</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Porque ele sempre executa, então não precisa de uma condição</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">A declaração <code>else</code> não tem uma condição </item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Porque sua condição é o oposto da condição da declaração <code>if</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Um programa verifica <code>if raining</code> antes de uma ramificação <code>else</code> que sugere óculos de sol. Quando essa ramificação alternativa é executada?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Quando <code>raining</code> é <code>False</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Quando <code>raining</code> é <code>True</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Sempre, porque <code>else</code> não tem uma condição escrita</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher Quando <code>raining</code> é <code>False</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Catch all",
            "id": 77840,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>O que acontece quando <code>common_friends</code> tem um valor menor que 3?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"common_friends = \" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" common_friends &gt;= \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\": \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Friend suggestions: Sue&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"else\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;No new suggestions&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"No new suggestions\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">O bloco de código do <code>else</code> é executado</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">O bloco de código do <code>if</code> é executado</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Nem o bloco <code>if</code>, nem o bloco de código da instrução <code>else</code> são executados</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">O bloco de código do <code>else</code> é executado.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Quais valores de <code>common_friends</code> exibem <code>Friend suggestions: Sue</code>?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"common_friends = \" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" common_friends &gt;= \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\": \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Friend suggestions: Sue&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"else\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;No new suggestions&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"No new suggestions\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>3</code> e qualquer número acima dele</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Qualquer número acima de <code>3</code>, mas não o próprio <code>3</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Qualquer número abaixo de <code>3</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>3</code> e qualquer número acima dele.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Lights on",
            "id": 77855,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Escolha um valor para <code>mad_meter</code> de modo que o bloco <code>else</code> seja executado.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"mad_meter = \" /><text value=\"79\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"mad_scientist = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Dexter&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" mad_meter &gt;= \" /><text value=\"134\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\": \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Madness achieved!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"else\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Sorry, &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + mad_scientist + \" /><text value=\"&quot;, not mad enough&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"12\" endIndex=\"14\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"134\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Sorry, Dexter, not mad enough\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>79</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Monte a verificação em <code>mad_meter</code> e escolha o valor dela para a condição <strong>não</strong> ser atendida e o código imprimir <code>Sorry, Dexter, not mad enough</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"mad_meter = \" /><text value=\"79\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"mad_scientist = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Dexter&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" mad_meter &gt;= \" /><text value=\"134\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\": \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Madness achieved!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"else\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Sorry, &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + mad_scientist + \" /><text value=\"&quot;, not mad enough&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"12\" endIndex=\"14\" /><option startIndex=\"54\" endIndex=\"56\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"134\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&lt;=\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Sorry, Dexter, not mad enough\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>79</code> seguido de <code>&gt;=</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
