          {
            "title": "Question: Adding elif",
            "id": 78075,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>O que este código exibe no console?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"temperature = \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" temperature &lt; \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Brr...&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"elif\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" temperature == \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;It's freezing!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"elif\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" temperature &lt; \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;It's cold out.&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"It's cold out.\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>It's cold out.</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>It's freezing!</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>Brr...</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>It's cold out.</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Qual valor de <code>temperature</code> faria este código exibir <code>It's freezing!</code>?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"temperature = \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" temperature &lt; \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Brr...&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"elif\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" temperature == \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;It's freezing!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"elif\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" temperature &lt; \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;It's cold out.&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"It's cold out.\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>0</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>5</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>-3</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>0</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: As many as we'd like",
            "id": 78079,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>A indentação de <code>print(\"My favorite color!\")</code> é diferente no primeiro bloco <code>if</code> em comparação com o segundo.</p><p>Este código gera um <code>IndentationError</code>. Qual bloco <code>if</code> o causa?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"color = \" /><text value=\"&quot;red&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" color == \" /><text value=\"&quot;blue&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Blue is awesome!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;My favorite color!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" color == \" /><text value=\"&quot;green&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Green is awesome!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;My favorite color!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"  File &quot;/home/code/file.py&quot;, line 4\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    print(&quot;My favorite color!&quot;)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"                               ^\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"IndentationError: unindent does not match any outer indentation level\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"\" /></content></output></code><selection multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">O bloco <code>\"blue\"</code>, como a indentação do segundo <code>print()</code> é diferente tanto do outro <code>print()</code> quanto do <code>if</code>, o computador não entende a que ele pertence</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">O bloco <code>\"green\"</code>, assim como o segundo <code>print()</code>, está indentado como a palavra-chave <code>if</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Ambos</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">O bloco <code>\"blue\"</code>, como a indentação do segundo <code>print()</code> é diferente tanto do outro <code>print()</code> quanto do <code>if</code>, o computador não entende a que ele pertence.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Você só pode editar a linha <code>print(\"My favorite color!\")</code> na ramificação <code>\"blue\"</code>.</p><p>Qual alteração corrige o erro e mantém essa linha dentro da ramificação?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"color = \" /><text value=\"&quot;red&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" color == \" /><text value=\"&quot;blue&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Blue is awesome!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;My favorite color!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" color == \" /><text value=\"&quot;green&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Green is awesome!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;My favorite color!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"  File &quot;/home/code/file.py&quot;, line 4\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    print(&quot;My favorite color!&quot;)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"                               ^\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"IndentationError: unindent does not match any outer indentation level\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"\" /></content></output></code><selection multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Indente-a para corresponder a <code>print(\"Blue is awesome!\")</code>.</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Mova-a para a esquerda para alinhá-la com a linha <code>if</code>.</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Indente-a mais do que <code>print(\"Blue is awesome!\")</code>.</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Indente-a para corresponder a <code>print(\"Blue is awesome!\")</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: As many as we'd like",
            "id": 78601,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Adicione outra declaração <code>elif</code> que execute se <code>hours</code> for maior que <code>5</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"hours = \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" hours &lt;= \" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Occasional app use&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"elif\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" hours &lt;= \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Moderate app use&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"elif\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" hours &gt; \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Frequent app use&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"101\" endIndex=\"105\" /><option startIndex=\"106\" endIndex=\"115\" /><option startIndex=\"115\" endIndex=\"116\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"else\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Moderate app use\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>elif</code> seguido de <code>hours &gt; 5</code> e finalmente <code>:</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Adicione um ramo final que executa quando <code>hours</code> é maior que <code>5</code>, para esta execução imprimir <code>Frequent app use</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"hours\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"7\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"hours\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"print\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Occasional app use&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"elif\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"hours\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"print\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Moderate app use&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"elif\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"hours\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"print\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Frequent app use&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"101\" endIndex=\"105\" /><option startIndex=\"106\" endIndex=\"115\" /><option startIndex=\"115\" endIndex=\"116\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"hours &gt; 7\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Frequent app use\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>elif</code> seguido de <code>hours &gt; 5</code> e finalmente <code>:</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
