            "id": 80483,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Quantas condições alternativas estão vinculadas neste código?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"like_author = \" /><text value=\"False\" class=\"literal\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"like_genre = \" /><text value=\"True\" class=\"literal\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"got_recommendation = \" /><text value=\"True\" class=\"literal\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" like_author \" /><text value=\"or\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" like_genre \" /><text value=\"or\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" got_recommendation:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Buy book&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"Buy book\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Três</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Um</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Não há condições alternativas, todas devem ser <code>True</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher Três.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Suponha que <code>got_recommendation</code> mude para <code>False</code>. O que o código alterado faria?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"like_author = \" /><text value=\"False\" class=\"literal\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"like_genre = \" /><text value=\"True\" class=\"literal\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"got_recommendation = \" /><text value=\"True\" class=\"literal\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" like_author \" /><text value=\"or\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" like_genre \" /><text value=\"or\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" got_recommendation:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Buy book&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"Buy book\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Ele ainda exibiria <code>Buy book</code> porque <code>like_genre</code> é <code>True</code>.</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Ele não exibiria nada porque uma condição é <code>False</code>.</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Ele não exibiria nada porque a primeira condição é <code>False</code>.</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Ele ainda exibiria <code>Buy book</code> porque <code>like_genre</code> é <code>True</code>.</p></body></html>"
